---
// src/components/Footer.astro
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer>
  <div class="wrap top">
    <div class="col">
      <h3>中友地政士事務所</h3>
      <p>台中市東區東英七街 55 號</p>
      <p>服務據點｜有巢氏房屋太平中山富盛店<br>台中市太平區中山路四段 122 號</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <h3>聯絡方式</h3>
      <p><a href="tel:+886955377283">0955-377-283</a></p>
      <p>LINE <a href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/%400955377283" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@0955377283</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/chunhao.tsai1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook 蔡峻豪地政士</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <h3>網站導覽</h3>
      <nav>
        <a href="/about/">關於本所</a><a href="/posts/">專欄文章</a><a href="/services/">服務項目</a><a href="/fees/">收費標準</a>
        <a href="/faq/">常見問題</a><a href="/tools/">稅費線上試算</a><a href="/contact/">聯絡我們</a><a href="/disclaimer/">免責聲明</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="bottom">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span>© {year} 中友地政士事務所</span>
      <span>本站內容為一般性說明，非個案法律意見。稅務數字依財政部 115 年度公告，實際核定以國稅局為準。</span>
    </div>
    <p class="kw wrap">台中地政士事務所、台中代書推薦、東區代書、太平代書推薦、遺產稅申報、贈與稅試算、繼承登記、財產傳承規劃</p>
  </div>
  <button id="to-top" aria-label="回到頂端">↑</button>
</footer>
<style>
footer{background:var(--blue-d); color:rgba(255,255,255,.82); margin-top:80px; font-size:14px}
.top{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap:36px; padding-block:48px 40px}
.col h3{color:#fff; font-size:16px; letter-spacing:.12em; margin-bottom:14px; padding-bottom:10px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
.col p{margin:0 0 8px}
.col a{color:#fff; text-decoration:none}
.col a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.col nav{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px 16px}
.bottom{background:rgba(0,0,0,.18); padding-block:18px; font-size:12.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.65)}
.bottom .wrap:first-child{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; flex-wrap:wrap}
.kw{margin-top:8px; font-size:11.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); letter-spacing:.06em}
#to-top{position:fixed; right:18px; bottom:18px; width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:50%; border:0; background:var(--blue); color:#fff;
  font-size:18px; cursor:pointer; box-shadow:var(--shadow); opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .3s; z-index:40}
#to-top.show{opacity:1; pointer-events:auto}
@media (max-width:820px){ .top{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:26px} }
</style>
